"parts":[{"text":"மரம்","lemma":"மரம்","gloss":"tree"},{"text":"நிழல்","lemma":"நிழல்","gloss":"shade"}],"gloss":"tree shade"},{"surface":"பட்டு","parts":[{"text":"பட்டு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"having fallen"}],"gloss":"having fallen"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மலைமுதற்","parts":[{"text":"மலைமுதற்","lemma":"மலைமுதற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிறுநெறி","parts":[{"text":"சிறுநெறி","lemma":"சிறுநெறி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மணன்மிகத்","parts":[{"text":"மணன்மிகத்","lemma":"மணன்மிகத்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தாஅய்த்","parts":[{"text":"தாஅய்த்","lemma":"தாஅய்த்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"தண்மழை","parts":[{"text":"தண்மழை","lemma":"தண்மழை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தலையின்","parts":[{"text":"தலையின்","lemma":"தலையின்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றாக","parts":[{"text":"றாக","lemma":"றாக","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நந்நீத்துச்","parts":[{"text":"நந்நீத்துச்","lemma":"நந்நீத்துச்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"சுடர்வாய்","parts":[{"text":"சுடர்","lemma":"சுடர்","gloss":"glow / brightness"},{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"edge / tip"}],"gloss":"bright-edged"},{"surface":"நெடுவேல்","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"நெடு","gloss":"long"},{"text":"வேல்","lemma":"வேல்","gloss":"spear"}],"gloss":"long spear"},{"surface":"காளையொடு","parts":[{"text":"காளை","lemma":"காளை","gloss":"youth"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the youth"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மடமா","parts":[{"text":"மடம்","lemma":"மடம்","gloss":"innocence / gentleness"},{"text":"மா","lemma":"மா","gloss":"animal / beauty"}],"gloss":"innocent and beautiful"},{"surface":"அரிவை","parts":[{"text":"அரிவை","lemma":"அரிவை","gloss":"young woman"}],"gloss":"young woman"},{"surface":"போகிய","parts":[{"text":"போகிய","lemma":"போ","gloss":"who went"}],"gloss":"who went"},{"surface":"சுரன்","parts":[{"text":"சுரன்","lemma":"சுரன்","gloss":"desert path"}],"gloss":"desert path"},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]}],"literal":"The sun not scorching, falling in the shade of trees, / on the narrow path at the foot of the mountain, sand being abundantly spread, / may cool rain shower, having abandoned us, / with the youth of the bright-edged long spear, / the innocent young woman went into the desert path.","translation":"May the sun not scorch but fall gently through the shade of trees, may soft sand lie thick on the narrow path at the foot of the mountain, and may cool rain shower upon that desert path where my innocent young daughter, having abandoned us, has gone with her youth who carries a bright-edged long spear.","modern":"சூரியன் சுட்டெரிக்காமல் மரங்களின் நிழல் பட்டு, மலையடிவாரத்துச் சிறுவழியில் மணல் மிகுதியாகப் பரவி, குளிர்ந்த மழை பொழியட்டும்! எங்களை விட்டு நீங்கி, ஒளிரும் முனையையுடைய நீண்ட வேலை ஏந்திய காளையோடு, மடப்பமும் அழகும் கொண்ட என் மகள் சென்ற அந்தப் பாலைவனப் பாதையில்!","explanation":"The foster-mother (cevili) is speaking to herself, expressing her deep concern and love for her daughter who has eloped with her lover. She describes the harsh desert path (pālai) through which they are traveling. Instead of cursing the desert, her maternal love makes her pray that the sun does not scorch them, that tree shades protect them, that soft sand covers the narrow mountain paths, and that cool rain showers upon them. The imagery of the harsh desert path being transformed into a pleasant, shaded, and rain-cooled path reflects the mother's tender heart and her wish for her daughter's well-being despite the pain of abandonment. Key words include 'ñāyiṟu kāyātu' (sun not scorching), 'taṇmaḻai' (cool rain), and 'maṭamā arivai' (innocent young woman).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}